cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "atomipy topology generator"
message: "If you use the atomipy topology generator in your research, please cite it using the metadata below, together with the atomipy library it is built on."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Holmboe
    given-names: Michael
    email: michael.holmboe@umu.se
    affiliation: "Umeå University, Sweden"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-06-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mholmboe/atomipy-topology-generator"
url: "https://topology.atomipy.io"
abstract: >-
  A web application that automates atom typing and molecular topology
  generation for mineral and material systems, built on the atomipy Python
  library. It prepares structures for molecular dynamics simulations with the
  MINFF and CLAYFF force fields through a browser interface.
keywords:
  - molecular modelling
  - molecular dynamics
  - clay minerals
  - minerals
  - force field
  - topology
  - atom typing
  - MINFF
  - CLAYFF
  - GROMACS
  - web application
references:
  - type: software
    title: "atomipy: Atomistic Topology Operations in Python"
    authors:
      - family-names: Holmboe
        given-names: Michael
    repository-code: "https://github.com/mholmboe/atomipy"
